Notebook[{Cell["RequireBindings", "ObjectName"], 
  Cell["RequireBindings is an option of ValidateModularModel: True requires \
every used slot bound with full independent coverage of its space.", 
   "Usage"], Cell["Status: Alpha.", "Notes"], 
  Cell[
   "Option of ValidateModularModel: whether every used slot must be bound.", 
   "Notes"], Cell["False (default) reports the binding status; True fails \
